[gd_scene format=3]

; One variable: `visible = false` on a Node3D-derived type that draws nothing of its own. The
; orange box sits under a hidden AudioListener3D, so Godot hides it (node_3d.cpp:1132-1143) and
; only the grey reference draws. No other golden hides such a type, so a type that drops `visible`
; shows only here.

